        "created_at": "2012-10-10T12:29:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After thinking about each case, I would say that the first case is the most likely.&nbsp; It triggers once 5 or more damage has been dealt.&nbsp; After that, the condition has been met, and has no reason to keep firing (dismissing the third case).&nbsp; Also, it is stated that it occurs whenever 5 or more damage has been dealt, and not as at the end of each turn, if 5 or more damage has been dealt (dismissing the second case).</p>",
