        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"TheJayMann\"]\n\n(...) It triggers once 5 or more damage has been dealt.&nbsp; After that, the condition has been met, and has no reason to keep firing (dismissing the third case). (...)\n\n[/quote]\n\nWhile I also feel that, maybe, interpretation (1) is the intended, I don&#39;t really see how it can be assumed from the text that this specific card can only trigger once per turn when the condition is met (unlike just about all other cards)?&nbsp; Why wouldn&#39;t something like, say, &quot;Lead from the front&quot; trigger also only once (per turn? why?) when its condition is met ?\n\nAnyway, maybe playing it the &quot;hard way&quot; is not a bad idea: Baron Blade can use all the help he can get to put a decent challenge.\n\n&nbsp;\n",
