        "raw": "<p>The difference between&nbsp;Backlash Field&nbsp;and Lead from the Front is that Backlash Field was worded to trigger once the point of damage has increased to become 5 or more damage, whereas Lead from the Front is worded to trigger whenever&nbsp;a hero target would be dealt damage.&nbsp; Backlash Field&nbsp;was not worded such as &quot;Whenever Baron Blade is dealt damage, if he was dealt 5 or more damage this turn.&quot;&nbsp; Basically, there is no wording to say it triggers when damage is dealt, only when a certain amount of damage has passed, which can occur at most once (in this case, it states per turn, thus it can occur at most once per turn).</p>",
